      "guid": "shwng.camerarotation",
      "name": "Camera Position Control & Custom Weapon Stances",
      "slug": "camera-position-control-custom-weapon-stances",
      "teaser": "Take full control of your first-person view and weapon handling",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/sNoth36sbfxMe1IHH8ZvIiYJhl2O55nJ8Cdvxgee.png",
      "downloads": 10589,
      "favourites_count": 34,
      "description": "<h3>Camera Position Control</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Adjust your camera forward/backward, up/down, and sideways</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3 Custom Weapon Stances</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Create up to 3 weapon ready positions</li>\n<li>Customize both rotation and position  for each stance</li>\n<li>Cycle through stances with a hotkey (default: V)</li>\n<li>Smooth, adjustable transitions between stances</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3.11 Version Included</h3>\n<h3>Incompatible with other viewmodel / FOV mods</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><em>Disclaimer: Since I won’t be doing SPT modding for a foreseeable future, any user is free to modify and redistribute this mod</em></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/shengzhanzhe\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Buy Me a Coffee</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Screens:<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MYnoWCF.png\" alt=\"Image1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LsIIlnB.png\" alt=\"Image2\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ByUQWyH.png\" alt=\"Image1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z6KCOhu.png\" alt=\"Image1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DbujRBb.png\" alt=\"Image1\" /></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2572/camera-position-control-custom-weapon-stances",
      "fika_compatibility": false,
      "featured": false,
      "contains_ads": false,
      "contains_ai_content": true,
      "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>This mod was made heavily by using AI. Only the core hook method (the spring get method on player controller’s hands position / rotation) and the SmoothDamp method was written by hand. Offset calculations, config generation, state management branches were written by AI in order to speed up the release.</p>\n",
